# Game Design Document

## Game Overview
The game is a text-based adventure game where the player has to navigate through a maze and find the exit. The game will feature a simple text-based interface where the player can input commands to move around the maze.

## Game Mechanics

* The maze will be represented as a 2D grid of cells.
* The player will start at the entrance of the maze and have to navigate to the exit.
* The player can move up, down, left, or right using simple text-based commands.
* The game will feature obstacles such as walls and traps that the player will need to avoid.

## User Interface
The game will feature a simple text-based interface where the player can input commands to move around the maze. The game will display the current state of the maze and the player's position.
```

